The Matador is a action, comedy, crime film directed by Richard Shepard.

3
00:18:11,250 --> 00:18:17,250
The life of Danny Wright, a salesman forever on the road, veers into dangerous and surreal territory when he
wanders into a Mexican bar and meets a mysterious stranger, Julian, who's very likely a hit man.

4
